v 3
d estrec: Stata estimation results as estimation records (JSON)
d
d Run estrec write right after an estimation command to save its results as an
d estimation record: a small JSON file with the estimates, the vcov and its
d small-sample correction, N and drops, tests, and the software that ran it.
d Records from Stata, R and Python can then be compared without rerunning.
d
d Supported: regress, areg, xtreg (fe, re), reghdfe, ivregress, ivreg2, ivreghdfe,
d logit, logistic, probit, poisson, nbreg, glm. Other e-class commands get a
d core record with no profile claims.
d
d Requires: Stata 16 or newer
d Distribution-Date: 20261106
d License: MIT
d Author: the estimation format contributors
d Support: https://github.com/estimation-format/estimation/issues
f estrec.ado
f estrec.sthlp
